Lab 11: Virtual Machine Snapshots
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Understand the concept and importance of VM snapshots in virtualization environments
Create snapshots of running virtual machines using OpenShift Virtualization
Restore virtual machines from previously created snapshots
